\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Painting</b> is a decoration which can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a> for $1,600. The painting can be resized and filled with a material to occupy the frame. Once it is filled in, an image in a image pool is selected and put on the painting. The player also has the option to open a prompt which requests a image ID to be inputted.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830070820\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 58/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 46/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019399/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.743      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   27.743      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1400-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260830070820 and revision id 8838. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Structures"],"links":[{"title":"Illumine Designs","exists":true}],"images":["Unboxed_Painting_Oak.png","Imagem_2023-07-13_162054861.png"]}
